```
      },
    },
  },
    },
  },
})
```

But I only specified adding `host: true`. Why are there extra `},` and `},`?

Ah, looking at the diff more carefully: the oldString I provided was:
```
  server: {
    proxy: {
      '/api': {
        target: 'http://127.0.0.1:8000',
        changeOrigin: true,
      },
    },
  },
```
