```
export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],
  server: {
    host: true,
    proxy: {
      '/api': {
        target: 'http://127.0.0.1:8000',
        changeOrigin: true,
      },
    },
  },
    },
  },
})
```

This is definitely wrong. The original file I read had 16 lines:
```
